00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:29.570
tadashii datoka soujanai toka
Right or wrong

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:32.610
kudaranai ronsouwa
Nonsensical arguments

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:35.350
kieya shinai kedo
Never go away

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:39.780
shinjita kotowo shinjinuku koto
Believe what you believe in

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:42.750
sono sakini bokurawa
At the end of it all

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:45.490
hikari mitsukeru darou
We will find the light

00:01:45.490 --> 00:01:50.560
saa tokihanate ima
Now is the time to release it

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:53.500
kanjouni aragau nayo
